{"id":"c961381becd68499","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-prop-bounding-number.md","title":"Bounding Number","display":"prop-bounding-number — Bounding Number","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-bounding-number","aliases":["58-prop-bounding-number"],"display":"prop-bounding-number — Bounding Number","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-eventually-dominates.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-bounding-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-bounding-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-bounding-number — Bounding Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"77a760e1d14f97f9\" href=\"?note=77a760e1d14f97f9\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c224c738e223e7b\" href=\"?note=3c224c738e223e7b\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-eventually-dominates.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-eventually-dominates.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{b}\">\\(\\mathfrak{b}\\)</span> (bounding number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\">\\(\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> eventually dominates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>, from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiBoundingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak b)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiBoundingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak b)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"77a760e1d14f97f9\" href=\"?note=77a760e1d14f97f9\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}bounding-number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiBoundingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak b)\\to\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak b)\n\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n|B|=\\mathfrak b\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in B\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in C\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\\bigr]\n\\to\\mathfrak b\\leq|C|\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}bounding-number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiBoundingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak b)\\to\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak b)\n\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n|B|=\\mathfrak b\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in B\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in C\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\\bigr]\n\\to\\mathfrak b\\leq|C|\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak b\">\\(\\mathfrak b\\)</span> is the minimum size of a family unbounded in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\omega^\\omega,\\leq^*)\">\\((\\omega^\\omega,\\leq^*)\\)</span>; the witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> must fail to be dominated by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A witness family and the comparison with every unbounded family express the minimum without treating <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\">\\(\\min\\)</span> as a total primitive.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1 \\leq \\mathfrak{b} \\leq \\mathfrak{d} \\leq 2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\omega_1 \\leq \\mathfrak{b} \\leq \\mathfrak{d} \\leq 2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"77a760e1d14f97f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-eventually-dominates.md","status":"resolved","id":"3c224c738e223e7b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-eventually-dominates.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"77a760e1d14f97f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCiBoundingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak b)$（see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-ci-bounding-number.md]]）。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{b}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiBoundingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}bounding-number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiBoundingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak b)\\to\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak b)\n\\land\\exists B\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n|B|=\\mathfrak b\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in B\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall C\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall f\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in C\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{EventuallyDominates}_S(f,g)\\bigr]\n\\to\\mathfrak b\\leq|C|\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak b","display":false},{"tex":"(\\omega^\\omega,\\leq^*)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\min","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1 \\leq \\mathfrak{b} \\leq \\mathfrak{d} \\leq 2^{\\aleph_0}","display":false}],"bytes":1576,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3935","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-prop-bounding-number.md|58-prop-bounding-number]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["77a760e1d14f97f9","3c224c738e223e7b","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}